# The environment variables this project reads. They are read from the process
# environment: nothing here loads a .env file yet, so exporting them in your
# shell is what actually works today. Keeping them in a .env and sourcing it is
# a convention, and .env is gitignored precisely so that habit is safe.

# Where the JSON backend keeps its data. Defaults to the OS data directory
# when unset, so this is only needed to override it.
LEARNING_TRACKER_DATA=

# Added as the service grows: DATABASE_URL for the Postgres backend, and the
# Clerk issuer once the web layer verifies tokens. Secrets stay in the Railway
# service variables, never here.
